@startuml
autonumber
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam roundCorner 0
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam defaultFontColor black
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor black
    LifeLineBorderColor black
    ParticipantBorderColor black
    ParticipantBackgroundColor white
    ParticipantFontColor black
}

participant "AI Assistant" as A
participant "MCP Server" as M
participant "Context Loader" as C
participant "Litho Engine" as E

A -> M: initialize (client capabilities)
M --> A: initialized (protocol version, capabilities)

A -> M: tools/list
M --> A: tools list (build, validate, template_ops, extract_source)

A -> M: tools/call (name="build", arguments={markdown, template})
M -> M: validateArguments(schema)
M -> C: loadContext(template, skills.md)
C --> M: template manifest + schema + macros
M -> E: executeBuild(ast, template)
E --> M: compilationResult (pdfBytes, metadata)
M --> A: JSON-RPC result (PDF artifact + diagnostics)
A --> A: render preview for author
note over M: Errors return structured JSON-RPC error responses without terminating the MCP daemon.
@enduml
